OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright start for Northeast
OL,6,FHighland otherwise cloudy with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain turning heavier with
OL,8,Fsome snow on hills further south.
OL,9,FDrier around Inverness and the Great
OL,10,FGlen.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with rain continuing
OL,13,Finto the evening for most areas,
OL,14,Fbecoming drier for the Hebrides and
OL,15,Ffar west later in the night. Winds
OL,16,Feasing overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
