OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with rain turning
OL,6,Flight and patchy, turning wintry on
OL,7,Fthe hills, Hebrides and Skye seeing
OL,8,Fthe best of any brighter weather and
OL,9,Fmilder here too.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,12,Fdrier day on Wednesday but becoming
OL,13,Fwindy, rain skirting west later.
OL,14,FCloudy and damp on Friday with some
OL,15,Fwintry conditions on higher ground.
OL,16,FCold and bright Saturday, stronger
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
